[I] An extensible AI agent that goes beyond code suggestions

[T] goose is your on-machine AI agent, capable of automating complex
[T] development tasks from start to finish. More than just code suggestions,
[T] goose can build entire projects from scratch, write and execute code, debug
[T] failures, orchestrate workflows, and interact with external APIs -
[T] autonomously.

[U] https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose

[A] Block <ai-oss-tools@block.xyz>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/ai
[F] CROSS
[R] - alpha arc avr32 blackfin cris hppa hppa64 i860 m68k microblaze nios2 openrisc superh

[L] APL
[V] 1.59.2

[D] 9b3a654034fd338c6c4f25b4d9130c8adb85f1b75d94c2f993b1bf41 goose-1.59.2.tar.gz https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/archive/v1.59.2/

[ $prefix_auto = 1 ] && prefix="opt/goose" && set_confopt

cargoinstopt=
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -L$root$(pkgprefix libdir libxcb)
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' "*jitterentropy*?-O0"

atstage cross && hook_add postmake 5 "install target/${arch_target}/*/goose $root$bindir/"
atstage native && hook_add postmake 5 "install target/*/goose $root$bindir/"
